  <summary><span class="kind">theorem</span> <code>AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.FunctionalInequalities.GaussianCompactProductLogSobolev.compact_gaussian_pi_logSobolev</code> <span class="status status-yellow">Partial</span> <span class="status status-gray">Not mapped</span></summary><p data-lesson-link="AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.FunctionalInequalities.GaussianCompactProductLogSobolev.compact_gaussian_pi_logSobolev"><a href="../lessons/autosamplingtheory-technicallemmas-functionalinequalities-gaussiancompactproductlogsobolev-compact-gaussian-pi-logsobolev-7b134f7eb1af.html">Read the complete mathematical statement and proof, with Lean below each</a></p>
